        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Meaningless arguments will not help her situation right now. Intense emotions in her M.I.N.D. will only cause something to sprout."
